      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mannford%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Mannford sits next to Keystone Lake and claims to be the Striped Bass Capital of the World.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mannford%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Frisco railroad built a line through Mannford in the early 1900s, making the town an important cattle shipping point.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
