      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mannford%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Citizens of Mannford relocated the entire town several miles southeast in 1963 to avoid flooding from a flood control project.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
